			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"納西妲",
					"#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 30320401,
					"content": "這麼一來，你也是有名字的人了哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320402,
					"content": "綽號呢？想好了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320403,
					"content": "呃…呃，還在想…別催呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320404,
					"content": "慢慢想。在妳想好之前，我們暫時不必見面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320405,
					"content": "你打算做什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30320406,
					"content": "那些構陷我令我陷入不幸的人，遲早都會付出代價。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320407,
					"content": "是說愚人眾嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320408,
					"content": "至少是「博士」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320409,
					"content": "立場變化了呢，相信未來你的道路也會因此改變。但不是現在…你還需要一些時間來整理自己。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320410,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320411,
					"content": "還有一件事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320412,
					"content": "如今稻妻還有一些雷電五傳的後人。他們中有人知道…或者說，本該知道我與雷電五傳的關係。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320413,
					"content": "#我暫時不打算離開須彌，假如{F#妳}{M#你}在稻妻遇見他們，大可以告訴他們，我就是令雷電五傳隕落的凶手。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320414,
					"content": "…哪怕這件事已經從世界上抹除，他們也應該得到真相。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320415,
					"content": "原來如此…這是你的選擇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320416,
					"content": "欸？可是這樣一來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320417,
					"content": "沒什麼，只要他們願意，大可以用刀子捅進我的胸膛。…說不定本來就該是那樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320418,
						30320422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320418,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320419
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30320419,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}那是什麼眼神？不用露出這種表情，我知道自己在做什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320420,
					"content": "…會有那麼一天的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320421,
					"content": "好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320425,
					"content": "#再會了，賢明的神，還有{F#妳}{M#你}們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320426,
					"content": "走掉了呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320427,
					"content": "最近發生的事對他而言，簡直像是突然過完了一生。任何人都需要時間來平復心情吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320428,
					"content": "唔，也是。雖然他還是那樣，但語氣變得不那麼激烈了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320429,
					"content": "不管怎麼說，都結束了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320430
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30320430,
					"content": "這下我們總算可以去吃飯了吧？我都快餓死了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320431,
					"content": "#辛苦{F#妳}{M#你}們了，請找一個令人放鬆的地方盡情休息一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "納西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320422,
					"content": "我明白了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320423
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 30320423,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}很爽快，不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 30320424,
					"content": "…好了，就聊到這裡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						30320425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 303205,
			"completionStepIds": [
				303205
